---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="How to Plan Your Migration Abroad | AfriMigrate"
  description="How AfriMigrate helps Africans plan a move abroad in four steps: calculate, discover, prepare, apply — all with free tools, no consultant fees."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / How It Works</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">How It Works</div>
  <h1>From idea to invitation</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    Migration planning shouldn't require a consultant and a few thousand pounds. Here's exactly how to use AfriMigrate to go from "which country?" to a submitted, confident application.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="steps" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);">
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">🧮</div><h3>1. Calculate</h3><p>Get your CRS score or points test score in under 3 minutes, for free.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">🔍</div><h3>2. Discover</h3><p>See which visa pathways you actually qualify for, ranked by your chances.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">📋</div><h3>3. Prepare</h3><p>Build your document checklist and know exactly what to gather, and when.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">✈️</div><h3>4. Apply</h3><p>Follow your roadmap and submit your application with total confidence.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt" style="border-radius: var(--rl);">
    <div class="eyebrow">Pick Your Destination</div>
    <h2>Where do you want to go?</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Each destination has its own points system, document requirements and timelines. Start with the one you're most drawn to.</p>
    <div class="dest-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);">
      <a href="/canada" class="dest-card live"><div class="dest-flag">🇨🇦</div><div class="dest-name">Canada</div><div class="live-pip">Live</div></a>
      <a href="/uk" class="dest-card live"><div class="dest-flag">🇬🇧</div><div class="dest-name">UK</div><div class="live-pip">Live</div></a>
      <a href="/australia" class="dest-card live"><div class="dest-flag">🇦🇺</div><div class="dest-name">Australia</div><div class="live-pip">Live</div></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Why Free</div>
    <h2>No jargon. One clear plan.</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Immigration consultants often charge thousands for information that's publicly available but scattered across dozens of government websites. AfriMigrate exists to put it all in one place, explained simply, for free — forever.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
